MewStage vendor patch allocation/0004 (third_party/NOTICE): the retained scene pass no longer allocates on every
frame. Window keeps its scene-pass RenderDataRecorder for the context it wraps; SceneUpdate stages the scene's own
layer-root array when the layers did not change; RenderDirtyRegistry drops unreachable visuals by scene
(RemoveVisualsNotIn) instead of through a capturing lambda; and its Queued view is typed as the dictionary, so a
foreach over it does not box an enumerator. No behavioural change.

